<title>POLAND: BOS Q1 net rises to PLN 21.47 mln.</title>
<headline>BOS Q1 net rises to PLN 21.47 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>BOS preliminary results for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997     Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		     30.54   vs  16.83</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 30.54   vs  16.83</p>
<p>    net profit			     21.47   vs   8.93</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Bank Ochrony Srodowiska SA</p>
<p>    revenues from securities	    0.00   vs   0.05</p>
<p>    interest and similar revenues    57.92   vs  55.88</p>
<p>    interest and similar costs	 25.79   vs  35.19</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    revenues from commission	   12.01   vs   3.86</p>
<p>    costs of commission		   0.18   vs   0.20</p>
<p>    income tax				9.07   vs   7.90</p>
<p>    other taxes			     0.00   vs   0.00</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit/loss	   0.00   vs   0.00</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
